# Charts

- Consult `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/testing-strategy.md` for boundaries and validation.
- Keep UTC timestamps in the model and format dates only in the presentation layer.
- Preserve the units, precision, colors, and series order for each metric.
- Do not couple chart components to the raw API payload.
- Synchronize tooltip and crosshair by the nearest timestamp.
- Use the imperative Highcharts API without triggering React renders on `mousemove`.
- Remove listeners and references during cleanup; prevent duplicate handlers in StrictMode.
- Do not recreate instances or options without a demonstrated need.
- Validate resize behavior, overflow, missing data, and mouse interaction across all three charts.
- Test our data preparation and synchronization; do not test Highcharts internals in JSDOM.
